{"ref":"BDB, גָּזַר","hw":"גָּזַר","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַר</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. cut, divide (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَزَرَ</span>, NH <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַר</span> <em>cut, determine, circumcise;</em> Ethiopic ገዘረ Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּזַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܙܰܪ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.17\">Hb 3:17</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּגְזֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.19\">Is 9:19</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְזַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:28\" href=\"/Job.22.28\">Jb 22:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּגְזְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.4\">2 K 6:4</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּזֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:13\" href=\"/Psalms.136.13\">ψ 136:13</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>divide, cut in two</em>, sq. acc. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.25\">1 K 3:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ג׳ לִשְׁנָ֑יִם)</span> cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.26\">26</a> (obj. not expressed). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>divide</em> the Red Sea (acc.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:13\" href=\"/Psalms.136.13\">ψ 136:13</a> sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִגְזָרִים</span>. <strong>3.</strong>  <em>cut down</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֵצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.4\">2 K 6:4</a>. <strong>4.</strong>  <em>cut off</em> (piece of meat to eat, but obj. not expr. ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אכל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.19\">Is 9:19</a>. <strong>5.</strong>  <em>cut off</em>, i.e. <em>destroy, exterminate</em> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.17\">Hb 3:17</a> (c. acc.; indef. subj.), sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> loc. <strong>6.</strong>  <em>decree</em> (Aramaism, cf. Biblical Aramaic) <a data-ref=\"Job 22:28\" href=\"/Job.22.28\">Jb 22:28</a> c. acc.<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְזַר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.21\">2 Ch 26:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:1\" href=\"/Esther.2.1\">Est 2:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְזָ֑רְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:54\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.54\">La 3:54</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגֳז֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:6\" href=\"/Psalms.88.6\">ψ 88:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְזַרְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 37:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.37.11\">Ez 37:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.8\">Is 53:8</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>be cut off</em>, separated, excluded from <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִן)</span> temple <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.21\">2 Ch 26:21</a>, from <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִן)</span> Yahweh’s hand <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:6\" href=\"/Psalms.88.6\">ψ 88:6</a> (of the slain), from <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִן)</span> the land of the living <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.8\">Is 53:8</a> (of the suffering servant of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>be cut off</em> = <em>destroyed</em> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:54\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.54\">La 3:54</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 37:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.37.11\">Ez 37:11</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  <em>be decreed</em>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:1\" href=\"/Esther.2.1\">Est 2:1</a> sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <em>against</em> (cf. <strong>Qal 6</strong>).","next":"BDB, גֶּ֫זֶר","prev":"BDB, גֶּ֫זַע"}